### Result
- [Screenshot of viewport](../../../../../tmp/opencode/afterglow.jpg)
### Ran Playwright code
```js
// Screenshot viewport and save it as ../../../../../tmp/opencode/afterglow.jpg
await page.screenshot({
  path: '../../../../../tmp/opencode/afterglow.jpg',
  quality: 90,
  scale: 'css',
  type: 'jpeg'
});
```

### Result
{
  "ending": "A spark, honestly",
  "result": "A mutual connection · a sweet beginning",
  "gameHidden": true
}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('async () => { for (let i=0;i<6;i++) { document.querySelector(\'.choice\').click(); if (i<5) document.querySelector(\'#next\').click(); } document.querySelector(\'#next\').click(); return {ending:document.querySelector(\'#ending-title\').textContent, result:document.querySelector(\'#ending-result\').textContent, gameHidden:document.querySelector(\'#game\').classList.contains(\'hidden\')}; }');
```

### Result
{
  "viewport": 390,
  "documentWidth": 375,
  "endingVisible": true
}
### Ran Playwright code
```js
await page.evaluate('() => ({viewport:innerWidth, documentWidth:document.documentElement.scrollWidth, endingVisible:!document.querySelector(\'#ending\').classList.contains(\'hidden\')})');
```
